# Package A: side contracts south.
%rec: journalEntry
%key: id

id: the_duck
name: The Duck
skill_points: 3
#
start_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(duck)') || HasFlag('TalkedTo(synth_duck)')
start_text:
+ Anna Whitaker's synth duck waddled off. Big Bob saw it go down the manhole behind his store,
+ into the sewers, among the rats. She pays 100 sat to get it back.
#
prog_cond: HasItem('synth_duck_item')
prog_text: You have the duck. Anna wants it back. Bob wants its parts, and he pays better.
#
end_cond: HasFlag('duck_returned')
end_text: Anna has her duck. 100 sat and a friend in the fashion business.
end_id: returned
#
end_cond: HasFlag('duck_sold_to_bob') && HasFlag('told_anna_duck_dead')
end_text: Bob paid 300 for the parts. Anna believes the rats got it. She grieves; he builds.
end_id: sold_and_lied
#
end_cond: HasFlag('duck_sold_to_bob')
end_text: Bob has the duck in pieces and you have 300 sat. Anna is still waiting at the window.
end_id: sold
end_skill_points: 2
#
end_cond: HasFlag('Killed(synth_duck)')
end_text: The duck is dead. Nobody pays for that.
end_id: duck_dead
end_skill_points: 0

id: tags
name: Tags
skill_points: 4
#
start_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(tags)') || HasFlag('took_dog_tag')
start_text:
+ Lucy of Terra Vitae lost her son Burton in the cleansing. His body lies with the others outside
+ the southern wall. She wants his dog tag. The gate watch calls that grave robbing.
#
prog_cond: HasItem('burton_dog_tag')
prog_text: You have Burton's tag. Lucy pays 100. Richard Shaw in the commerce district collects cleansing relics and pays more.
#
end_cond: HasFlag('tag_returned')
end_text: Lucy wears her son's tag now. Terra Vitae remembers who brought it.
end_id: returned
#
end_cond: HasFlag('tag_sold') && HasFlag('lucy_knows')
end_text: Shaw paid 400 for Burton's tag. Lucy found out. Terra Vitae's doors are closed to you.
end_id: sold_and_caught
end_skill_points: 1
#
end_cond: HasFlag('tag_sold') && HasFlag('lied_to_lucy')
end_text: Shaw paid 400 for Burton's tag. Lucy believes her son was never found. She still looks south.
end_id: sold_and_lied
#
end_cond: HasFlag('tag_sold')
end_text: Richard Shaw has Burton's tag in his case. Lucy is still waiting.
end_id: sold
end_skill_points: 2

id: rats
name: Rats
skill_points: 2
#
start_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(rats)') || HasFlag('cleaner_went_down')
start_text:
+ The cleaner in the west was hired to clear the sewer rats under the southside and is too afraid to go down.
+ He pays 150 sat if the sewers go quiet. Big Bob sells rat poison; the sewer trash heap is where the rats feed.
#
prog_cond: HasItem('rat_poison')
prog_text: Rat poison. Drop it in the trash heap down in the sewers and give it two hours.
#
end_cond: HasFlag('rats_paid')
end_text: The sewers are quiet. The cleaner paid 150 and kept his job without ever going down.
end_id: paid
#
end_cond: HasFlag('KilledByPlayer(cleaner)')
end_text: The cleaner is dead. The west gets dirtier from here.
end_id: cleaner_killed
end_skill_points: 0
#
end_cond: HasFlag('cleaner_dead')
end_text: You told the cleaner to do his own job. He did. The rats ate him, and the west has nobody to clean up after it now.
end_id: cleaner_dead
